    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923230/extras/0bf95fbda60b07cd115e7dd3ebc1263a.poster.avif?t=1743437537\" width=640 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923230/extras/0bf95fbda60b07cd115e7dd3ebc1263a.webm?t=1743437537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923230/extras/0bf95fbda60b07cd115e7dd3ebc1263a.mp4?t=1743437537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the crime of cheese theft, <strong>Piper the mouse</strong> has been <strong>imprisoned</strong> in the highest tower of the Rats' castle. These Rats wield the power of <strong>&quot;Rules&quot;</strong>, mighty scrolls that grant the holder <strong>commanding power</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piper 'borrows' a Rules Scroll, escaping their cell and ready to face the Castle's many <strong>traps and puzzles</strong>. The descent will be tricky, but with the power of Rules, perhaps Piper can just squeak through! \ud83d\udc01\ud83d\udca8 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET RULES TO CONTROL CASTLE AND CRITTER ALIKE! \ud83d\udcdc</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rules</strong> grant you power over your environment and enemies. Abuse the heck out of this to solve <strong>puzzles!</strong> \ud83e\udde9 Grab <strong>scrolls</strong> to unlock new Rule powers! Combine different Rules to discover hidden interactions! Rats <strong>always follow the Rules...</strong> now go and <strong>mess with them!!</strong> \ud83d\udc00 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DODGE TRICKY TRAPS AND MAKE CHEDDAR! \ud83e\uddc0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite Rat architects have crafted <strong>30+ rooms of insidious puzzles</strong>. \ud83c\udff0 Solve them to escape, and grab all the <strong>cheese</strong> you can along the way! Unlock the latest <strong>Mouse Fashions</strong> by completing your cheese collection! \ud83e\udde5 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I'M A LOVER, NOT A FIGHTER! \ud83e\udd0e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No attacks? No problem! <strong>Use your wits</strong> to overcome bosses by <strong>manipulating their arena</strong> with Rules! Solve puzzles on the fly in a deadly game of <strong>rat and mouse!</strong> \ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules &amp; Rodents is a text-free game where communication is visual. We hope people of all languages will enjoy it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created for and voted #1 in the <strong>Unity Create with Code 2 Game Jam</strong>, Gravy Crew is delighted to present this full, expanded version of <strong>Rules &amp; Rodents!</strong> \ud83d\udcdc\ud83d\udc00</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923230/extras/0bf95fbda60b07cd115e7dd3ebc1263a.poster.avif?t=1743437537\" width=640 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923230/extras/0bf95fbda60b07cd115e7dd3ebc1263a.webm?t=1743437537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923230/extras/0bf95fbda60b07cd115e7dd3ebc1263a.mp4?t=1743437537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the crime of cheese theft, <strong>Piper the mouse</strong> has been <strong>imprisoned</strong> in the highest tower of the Rats' castle. These Rats wield the power of <strong>&quot;Rules&quot;</strong>, mighty scrolls that grant the holder <strong>commanding power</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piper 'borrows' a Rules Scroll, escaping their cell and ready to face the Castle's many <strong>traps and puzzles</strong>. The descent will be tricky, but with the power of Rules, perhaps Piper can just squeak through! \ud83d\udc01\ud83d\udca8 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET RULES TO CONTROL CASTLE AND CRITTER ALIKE! \ud83d\udcdc</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rules</strong> grant you power over your environment and enemies. Abuse the heck out of this to solve <strong>puzzles!</strong> \ud83e\udde9 Grab <strong>scrolls</strong> to unlock new Rule powers! Combine different Rules to discover hidden interactions! Rats <strong>always follow the Rules...</strong> now go and <strong>mess with them!!</strong> \ud83d\udc00 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DODGE TRICKY TRAPS AND MAKE CHEDDAR! \ud83e\uddc0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite Rat architects have crafted <strong>30+ rooms of insidious puzzles</strong>. \ud83c\udff0 Solve them to escape, and grab all the <strong>cheese</strong> you can along the way! Unlock the latest <strong>Mouse Fashions</strong> by completing your cheese collection! \ud83e\udde5 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I'M A LOVER, NOT A FIGHTER! \ud83e\udd0e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No attacks? No problem! <strong>Use your wits</strong> to overcome bosses by <strong>manipulating their arena</strong> with Rules! Solve puzzles on the fly in a deadly game of <strong>rat and mouse!</strong> \ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules &amp; Rodents is a text-free game where communication is visual. We hope people of all languages will enjoy it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created for and voted #1 in the <strong>Unity Create with Code 2 Game Jam</strong>, Gravy Crew is delighted to present this full, expanded version of <strong>Rules &amp; Rodents!</strong> \ud83d\udcdc\ud83d\udc00</p>",
    "short_description": "A puzzling adventure where you abuse the Rules set by your Rat captors! \ud83d\udcdc\ud83d\udc00 Manipulate enemies and environments with the commanding power of Rules to escape!",
